<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Bezeq Q2 net up.</title>
<headline>Israel's Bezeq Q2 net up.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bezeq Israel Telecom.</p>
<p>			 (In thousands of shekels )</p>
<p>			 Q2 96	 Q2 95	6-MTH 96    6-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		1,985,465   1,877,390  3,891,259   3,716,154</p>
<p>Operating profit     355,158     403,764    609,878     746,069</p>
<p>Net profit	     155,178     122,997    301,921     273,540</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
